close_reason: "All 18 PR 7 findings triaged (13 fixed, 5 declined with recorded reasons). release:check green: typecheck, build, lint (0 violations), duplicates (0 clones 0.00%), docstring (8 files/52 declarations), coverage (8 source files 100/100/100, 92 tests pass), audit:identities (3 approved), audit:prod (0 vulns), pack:dry-run (16-file tarball, no dist/scripts), changelog:check (up to date). Each touched gate mutation-verified to fail on a real violation then restored."
